{
  "uid": "at9fgw",
  "title": "MapColonies Status (beta)",
  "description": "Central status page: teams (mclabels), infrastructure, alerts. MAPCO-5786.",
  "tags": [
    "status-page",
    "mclabels",
    "beta"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Site",
        "label": "Site",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Teams",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Team status",
      "description": "One tile per mclabels owner \u2014 new teams appear automatically. Click to open the team page.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${Site}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(min by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (label_replace(min by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (max by (mapcolonies_io_owner, app_kubernetes_io_name) (up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\", mapcolonies_io_criticality=\"customer\"})), \"src\", \"up\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(min by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (label_replace(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}, \"mapcolonies_io_owner\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\")), \"src\", \"probe\", \"\", \"\")) or group by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\"})) * (0.25 + 0.25 * (min by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (max by (mapcolonies_io_owner, app_kubernetes_io_name) (up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\", mapcolonies_io_criticality=\"internal\"})) or group by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\"})) * (1 + 2 * min by (mapcolonies_io_owner) (up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\"})))",
          "legendFormat": "{{mapcolonies_io_owner}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "",
          "decimals": null,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Operational",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0.5": {
                  "text": "Degraded",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "0.25": {
                  "text": "Internal Outage",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "Customer Outage",
                  "color": "dark-red",
                  "index": 3
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "dark-red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open ${__field.labels.mapcolonies_io_owner} status page",
              "targetBlank": false,
              "url": "/d/a6j7gg/team-status-page-beta?var-owner=${__field.labels.mapcolonies_io_owner}&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 16,
          "valueSize": 20
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Legend",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Team status** (from `up` + mclabels, click a tile to open the team page)\n\ud83d\udfe2 Operational \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe0 Degraded (replica / unassigned service down) \u00b7 \ud83d\udd34 Internal Outage (`internal` service down) \u00b7 \ud83d\udd34 Customer Outage (`customer` service down **or** a blackbox endpoint probe fails)\n\n**Customer endpoints**: blackbox HTTP probes per team (public URLs and in-cluster liveness checks) (min = any URL failing \u2192 Down).\n\n**Uptime by team**: per service, averaged over the time range, split by `mclabels.criticality`. *unassigned* = criticality not set yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Customer endpoints (blackbox probes)",
      "description": "URLs probed by blackbox-exporter-<team>. Down = at least one URL of the team fails.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${Site}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min by (team) (label_replace(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}, \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{team}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "",
          "decimals": null,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Up",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "Down",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open ${__field.labels.team} status page",
              "targetBlank": false,
              "url": "/d/a6j7gg/team-status-page-beta?var-owner=${__field.labels.team}&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Failing probes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${Site}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "maxDataPoints": 1440,
      "description": "Blackbox probes failing right now. Empty = all probes pass.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (team, instance, job) (label_replace((probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 0), \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (team, instance, job) (label_replace((probe_http_status_code{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}) and on (instance, job) (probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 0), \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (team, instance, job) (label_replace((probe_duration_seconds{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}) and on (instance, job) (probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 0), \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (team, instance, job) (label_replace(((1 - avg_over_time(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}[$__range])) * 100) and on (instance, job) (probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 0), \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (team, instance, job) (label_replace((max_over_time(timestamp(probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 1)[$__range:$__interval]) * 1000) and on (instance, job) (probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 0), \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "refId": "E",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (team, instance, job) (label_replace((probe_failed_due_to_regex{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}) and on (instance, job) (probe_success{job=~\"blackbox-exporter-.*\", job!=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"} == 0), \"team\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"blackbox-exporter-([a-z0-9]+).*\"))",
          "refId": "F",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value #A": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "team": 0,
              "instance": 1,
              "Value #B": 2,
              "Value #E": 3,
              "Value #D": 4,
              "Value #C": 5,
              "Value #F": 6,
              "job": 7
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "team": "Team",
              "instance": "URL",
              "job": "Probe job",
              "Value #B": "HTTP status",
              "Value #C": "Probe duration",
              "Value #D": "Failed % (time range)",
              "Value #E": "Last success",
              "Value #F": "Body check failed"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "\u2705 No failing probes",
          "custom": {
            "align": "left",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "HTTP status"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "No response (timeout / refused)",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "401": {
                        "text": "401 Unauthorized",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "403": {
                        "text": "403 Forbidden",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "404": {
                        "text": "404 Not Found",
                        "index": 3
                      },
                      "500": {
                        "text": "500 Server Error",
                        "index": 4
                      },
                      "502": {
                        "text": "502 Bad Gateway",
                        "index": 5
                      },
                      "503": {
                        "text": "503 Unavailable",
                        "index": 6
                      },
                      "504": {
                        "text": "504 Gateway Timeout",
                        "index": 7
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Probe duration"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed % (time range)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Last success"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeFromNow"
              },
              {
                "id": "noValue",
                "value": "not in time range"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Body check failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "no",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "yes",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "URL"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 330
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Team"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "HTTP status"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Team",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Uptime by team (%)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${Site}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "maxDataPoints": 1440,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "avg by (mapcolonies_io_owner, mapcolonies_io_criticality) (avg_over_time((max by (mapcolonies_io_owner, mapcolonies_io_criticality, mapcolonies_io_part_of, mapcolonies_io_component, app_kubernetes_io_name) (label_replace(label_replace(up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\"}, \"app_kubernetes_io_name\", \"unnamed\", \"app_kubernetes_io_name\", \"\"), \"mapcolonies_io_criticality\", \"unassigned\", \"mapcolonies_io_criticality\", \"\")) or on (mapcolonies_io_owner, mapcolonies_io_criticality, mapcolonies_io_part_of, mapcolonies_io_component, app_kubernetes_io_name) ((0 * group by (mapcolonies_io_owner, mapcolonies_io_criticality, mapcolonies_io_part_of, mapcolonies_io_component, app_kubernetes_io_name) (label_replace(label_replace(last_over_time(up{mapcolonies_io_owner!=\"\"}[10m]), \"app_kubernetes_io_name\", \"unnamed\", \"app_kubernetes_io_name\", \"\"), \"mapcolonies_io_criticality\", \"unassigned\", \"mapcolonies_io_criticality\", \"\"))) and on () (count(up) > 0)))[$__range:$__interval])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "mapcolonies_io_criticality",
            "rowField": "mapcolonies_io_owner",
            "valueField": "Value",
            "emptyValue": "null"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "mapcolonies_io_owner\\mapcolonies_io_criticality": "Team"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "mapcolonies_io_owner\\mapcolonies_io_criticality": 0,
              "customer": 1,
              "internal": 2,
              "unassigned": 3
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "\u2014",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "\u2014",
                  "color": "transparent",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background",
              "mode": "basic"
            },
            "align": "center"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Team"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "auto"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Open team page",
                    "url": "/d/a6j7gg/team-status-page-beta?var-owner=${__value.raw}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Infrastructure",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Core infrastructure (TCP)",
      "description": "blackbox TCP probes: S3, PostgreSQL, SFTPGo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${Site}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"blackbox-exporter-tcp\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "",
          "decimals": null,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Up",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "Down",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "links": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "TLS certificates \u2014 days left",
      "description": "Earliest certificate expiry per probed host (probe_ssl_earliest_cert_expiry).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${Site}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${Site}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min by (host) (label_replace((probe_ssl_earliest_cert_expiry - time()) / 86400, \"host\", \"$1\", \"instance\", \"https?://([^/:?]+).*\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}",
